                    r6_o2:              `Skip the town hall — the diagnostic phase is not yet complete`,
                    r6_o3:              `Hold a Day-30 listening summary — share what you have heard, defer the strategy to Day 130`,

                    r7_context:         `Day 61–70 · The CFO seat · Walmart Centroamerica conversation`,
